<description>&lt;b&gt;WS-SLSV SMT Mini Slide Switch, Same Side Connection 7.65 x 5.5 mm &lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;B&gt;Material Properties&lt;/B&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;Frame Material	PA6T
&lt;BR&gt;Frame Flammability Rating	UL94 V-0
&lt;BR&gt;Frame Color	Black
&lt;BR&gt;Actuator Material	LCP
&lt;BR&gt;Actuator Flammability Rating	UL94 V-0
&lt;BR&gt;Actuator Color	Black
&lt;BR&gt;Contact Material	Copper Alloy
&lt;BR&gt;Contact Plating	Silver
&lt;BR&gt;Terminal Material	Copper Alloy
&lt;BR&gt;Terminal Plating	Silver
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;B&gt;General Information&lt;/B&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;Operating Temperature	-40 °C up to +85 °C
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;B&gt;Electrical Properties&lt;/B&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;IR	300 mA
&lt;BR&gt;VR	6 V (DC)
&lt;BR&gt;Contact Resistance Initial	50 mΩ
&lt;BR&gt;RISO	100 MΩ
&lt;BR&gt;Withstanding Voltage	500 V (AC)
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;B&gt;Mechanical Properties&lt;/B&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;Electrical Life	20000 Steps
&lt;BR&gt;Connection Type	Same Side Connection
&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;BR&gt;
